[{"title":"海客与文士谈仙","author":"孙元衡","text":"扶桑欲总辔，咸池先饮马。\n灵璅尽生烟，行见苍梧野。\n仙之人兮鹤与俱，纳新吐故何徐徐！\n舟气柁风寡滞迹，幄霄帏露成安居。\n八解池边观定水，九籥丹经洞生死。\n世间小别二千年，空里孤行九万里。\n渴时吮玉饥齧芝，鹿卢蹻下风云驰。\n匏魁统管含宫徵，熟簧生?云中吹。\n举举弄文人，挥手聊相谢。\n云霓随飘风，攀尔凤凰驾。\n羽人之国长如春，有何窟宅容其身。\n丹丘常明不知夜，未遑偃息劳精神。\n纵令怀英吸微液，那能醇粹还天真。\n骨肉断恩爱，煆炼脑与肠；徒然息心侣，万劫真茫茫。\n云旗玉轪空相望，回视九州非旧乡。\n海客掀髯发长啸，为斩尘根操墨阳。\n典籍为罟儒锻羽，衣冠是鼎儒沸汤。\n白蒿服户粪充囊，树兰不纫椒不芳。\n糺思编愁为佩纕，结鹑带索如人长。\n松宿天行无梗路，毳衣掩露含风裳。\n子行矣扪天摅影，虬螭青白遥相将。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":35110,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"海外饯客登舟，其情怀黯然，乃在离别之外，因为是诗","author":"孙元衡","text":"连山波阔远天垂，愁倍阳关酒满卮。\n展转别离无后约，丁宁珍重是危词。\n一盘针路漫漫夜，十丈帆风猎猎时。\n百里已遥千里近，计程疑速又疑迟。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":35111,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"春暮","author":"孙元衡","text":"三更风雨入庭院，落尽林花人不知。\n唤起春愁侵晓梦，一双鸲鹆在高枝。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":35112,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"赠许秀才远","author":"孙元衡","text":"傲骨崚嶒迥出尘，閒抛诗画与乡邻。\n韩康卖药梅生隐，道是寻常行路人。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":35113,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"旱","author":"孙元衡","text":"闽人虚畏甲申雨，海客真愁己卯风。\n千里霞光当日暮，一痕虹影在天东。\n尧忧不离耕桑事，禹贡难忘战伐功。\n绠短汲深增百虑，那因妻子念途穷。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":35114,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"寄答石泉明府悔人朱先生","author":"孙元衡","text":"石纽村中朱悔人，抛书西蜀到南闽。\n漫郎喜称閒司马，狂客惭无大钓纶。\n酒地老从山海拓，诗情寒与竹蕉亲。\n难忘锦里看花日，梦绕君边旧葛巾。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":35115,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"秋日杂诗二十首 其一","author":"孙元衡","text":"三年身入幻，味物海东丞。\n秋杳云俱化，霄虚鸟不胜。\n花于情未尽，山有目先登。\n一室粗能理，随时可曲肱。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":35116,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"秋日杂诗二十首 其二","author":"孙元衡","text":"八月浑如夏，冰纹枕簟斜。\n渴虹淹溽暑，毒雾莽风沙。\n破梦无名鸟，伤心未见花。\n自怜情漫浪，更拟著浮槎。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":35117,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"秋日杂诗二十首 其三","author":"孙元衡","text":"西偏惟落日，东向一烟峦。\n不爽针盘路，无形铁板关。\n鱼舠纷似叶，战舸静如山。\n深隐成安宅，毋忧海国顽。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":35118,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"秋日杂诗二十首 其四","author":"孙元衡","text":"北势到鸡笼，齐谐志怪同。\n瘴云凝自古，毒水澹于空。\n伏火从山鬼，惊涛驾海翁。\n舟回十二载，浮去弱洋东。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":35119,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"秋日杂诗二十首 其五","author":"孙元衡","text":"亦有奇情在，都疑梦里逢。\n潮生惊战鼓，日尽骇边烽。\n挟火麒麟飓，摧云傀儡锋。\n秋容何处好，千里木芙蓉。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":35120,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"秋日杂诗二十首 其六","author":"孙元衡","text":"诸蕃多窟宅，深就瘴云安。\n竹坞疑熊馆，茆居结马鞍。\n山荒朝猎豹，田熟夜防獾。\n此是羲皇上，文身似羽翰。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":35121,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"秋日杂诗二十首 其七","author":"孙元衡","text":"信此飘零眼，浮观别异同。\n四时无正候，百物有奇功。\n版籍翻稽妇，蛮村浑贱翁。\n糟醨聊可啜，应笑学郫筒。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":35122,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"秋日杂诗二十首 其八","author":"孙元衡","text":"眼底天民在，熙熙共往来。\n忘年惊发变，改岁待花开。\n即鹿群看箭，安家密咒灰。\n唱歌争款客，唤取女郎回。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":35123,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"秋日杂诗二十首 其九","author":"孙元衡","text":"海国多新意，生涯自不贫。\n清流环靛户，白水散?人。\n零露龙嘘漐，油云蜃积鳞。\n所嗟铅椠客，风俗未相亲。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":35124,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"秋日杂诗二十首 其十","author":"孙元衡","text":"殊方今乐国，襁负自成邻。\n饧酿酬田祖，蛮讴赛水神。\n蓣苗田鹿喜，蔗叶野牛驯。\n经术能师古，豳风属此人。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":35125,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"秋日杂诗二十首 其十一","author":"孙元衡","text":"秋雨滋筼箨，凄风养秀葽。\n醍醐閒伴少，榔枥野情遥。\n毂击煎饧灶，樯维煅蛎窑。\n喧嚣那可息，猿鹤漫相招。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":35126,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"秋日杂诗二十首 其十二","author":"孙元衡","text":"徙倚冈原上，关心草木缘。\n蕃花香酷烈，刺竹势㺦猭。\n廓落南东亩，奇零一两廛。\n此中无故物，霜鬓对寥天。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":35127,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"秋日杂诗二十首 其十三","author":"孙元衡","text":"物情殊熳烂，问俗竟何如。\n乐事喧鼍鼓，哀音转犊车。\n蕃荒逃火鹿，海熟上潮鱼。\n生理无妨陋，安恬可瑟居。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":35128,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"秋日杂诗二十首 其十四","author":"孙元衡","text":"劲风摧靡草，佻习厌陈人。\n斔斛全无较，吴蚕未见珍。\n肆狂呼五白，禳病叫三神。\n生聚如萍梗，何妨作酒民。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":35129,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"秋日杂诗二十首 其十五","author":"孙元衡","text":"欲补虫鱼注，徒多玩物情。\n文禽悬羽息，沙蟹寄螺生。\n守拙蟏蛸隐，争雄蜥蜴鸣。\n大都观变化，蠢蠢只空名。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":35130,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"秋日杂诗二十首 其十六","author":"孙元衡","text":"晚饭步空林，奇云生暮阴。\n天容自吞吐，夜气且浮沈。\n似电收光缓，疑霞幻影深。\n掉头归卧稳，平澹只初心。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":35131,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"秋日杂诗二十首 其十七","author":"孙元衡","text":"秋宵常独坐，宜楙漫相招。\n积水光摇动，连天气郁陶。\n蝠飞迎月露，鸡唱逐风潮。\n引领还空舍，余生本寂寥。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":35132,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"秋日杂诗二十首 其十八","author":"孙元衡","text":"节序飞腾易，无营作息宜。\n寒暄黄鸟在，晴雨绿鸠知。\n阅世恒如醉，忘情或近痴。\n形骸犹故我，欲问被衣师。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":35133,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"秋日杂诗二十首 其十九","author":"孙元衡","text":"草木无摇落，秋心亦自惊。\n远天澄一色，空宇会千声。\n选句收蛮语，耽游得鸟情。\n官閒兼寡合，例有竹蕉清。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":35134,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"秋日杂诗二十首 其二十","author":"孙元衡","text":"回首平生事，心将迹并奇。\n溯江曾学懒，入海为求诗。\n云水交相适，鱼龙两不疑。\n还舟无处觅，大火又西驰。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":35135,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"自安平镇风中返棹，波涛甚恶，归卧竟日而心犹悸，作诗自嘲","author":"孙元衡","text":"七里风涛万叠愁，归来不道小瀛洲。\n流云过影身摇动，空宇无声耳唧啾。\n飘泊樽罍三峡夜，黄昏枕簟九疑秋。\n自量终是尘凡客，海月应难挂席求。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":35136,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"不寐","author":"孙元衡","text":"短灯檠上花初烬，破荜窗中叶正飘。\n阔落无人惟吠犬，晦明如岁况秋宵。\n江淮故旧孰相忆，乡国音书何太遥？\n剩水残山半生事，断云别雨不终朝。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":35137,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"秋夜","author":"孙元衡","text":"高林一茅屋，秋尽成苍唐。\n蟋蟀吟夜户，似为劳者倡。\n涫?胸若波，宛转在空床。\n烧兰起弹瑟，可以亲鸾凰。\n宫徵良已昧，苦甘徒备尝。\n万事成琐尾，振衣东壁光。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":35138,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"海吼","author":"孙元衡","text":"我闻百物愤恚鸣穹苍，而何有于百谷之王？\n幽隘搏击成声光，而何有于祝融之汪？\n云胡吼怒弥昼夜，震撼鲛室喧龙堂？\n延听千声无远近，气沴风屯海为运。\n穷天拗忿悲莫伸，死地埋忧思欲奋。\n初时起类渔阳挝，七鲲喷沫开谽谺。\n繁响渐臻有嘘噏，万蹄按辔行虚沙。\n倏如战胜轰千轴，刮乾戾坤为起伏。\n漓以山摧熊虎号，砰磕成雷魔母哭。\n山摧石烂如寒灰，雷霆翻空偶驰逐。\n尔乃十日、五日吼不休，使我耳聋心矗矗。\n或言訇哮由积风，挂席长梢凝碧空。\n或言狂潮本澜汗，进则剽沙礐石争来攻，退则馀波呀呷殿成功；为魁为窟奔海童，朝夕池边历岁月，去来喧寂将毋同。\n老农又言徵在雨，黑螭隐见青鼍舞。\n叫啸年来彻霄汉，炎威千里成焦土。\n泱泱海若大难名，我欲问之阻长鲸。\n水德懦弱惧民玩，庶几赫怒张奇兵。\n大贤崇实戒虚声，股肱之喜良非轻。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":35139,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"客居 其一","author":"孙元衡","text":"蓬龙云骑走天涯，纵复端居昧岁华。\n开卷古人如在梦，挥杯尘物又争哗。\n秋深路远难听雨，地僻庭空忽见花。\n心识雁鸿纵不到，凫飞惊看一行斜。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":35140,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"客居 其二","author":"孙元衡","text":"虚室胡床耐曲肱，秋宵展转倍难仍。\n?簩细响蕉成雨，蜻蛚微吟蛾扑灯。\n客路浑如胶冻舫，宦情直似打包僧。\n诗坛酒社俱多梗，万事逢人谢不能。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":35141,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"偶有故园之思，辄以自解","author":"孙元衡","text":"乡梦初回月已沈，霜根旅鬓自萧森。\n莼鲈惹恨非佳味，鸿雁牵愁岂义禽。\n关塞老凭寒饿骨，海山閒付短长吟。\n百年万事皆如戏，何处翱翔非邓林。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":35142,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"题凤山邑署柬澄庵","author":"孙元衡","text":"山光延海色，新县旧营边。\n作吏有三载，所居惟一廛。\n秋花隐怪石，夕鸟翻寒烟。\n鼓角夜悲壮，知予耐稳眠。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":35143,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"途次喜晴，先寄署中诸子","author":"孙元衡","text":"林回水曲笋舆轻，日趁秋原暖气行。\n鸟路云衢多窈窕，峦光天色最分明。\n宛如醉魄淹归梦，直似春愁散野情。\n好事呼童扫花径，提壶相待或相迎。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":35144,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"戏成","author":"孙元衡","text":"一室难为理，卑栖傍草莱。\n秋衣炎未著，夜户瘴难开。\n肘腋防蚊患，床帷告蚁灾。\n从教迟簿领，莫遣负樽罍。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":35145,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"夜","author":"孙元衡","text":"深宵原寂寞，孤馆况萧骚。\n风乱星光动，潮平月影高。\n虫声低在枕，露气暗侵袍。\n心识乡程远，空令改二毛。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":35146,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"秋旱","author":"孙元衡","text":"骄亢入秋天，村中乏井泉。\n斗潮风乍起，厄雨电争先。\n日御翻黄雾，云峰化紫烟。\n何当归老眼，吾道巳堪怜！","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":35147,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"自适","author":"孙元衡","text":"平生未解隔宵愁，放达能经万里游。\n不遣归心随去鸟，但将高兴答清秋。\n暖风动幕花光乱，凉月盈樽露气浮。\n嫩绿文来蓣薯熟，甘香绝胜稻粮谋。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":35148,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"海市清言","author":"孙元衡","text":"白沙洲软长莓苔，盖屋青林不用栽。\n两乳燕投孤垒宿，四时花共一瓶开。\n巧人西域营工到，估舶东吴载酒来。\n解语鹦哥成五色，更无鸟译费疑猜。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":35149,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"梦游蜀道","author":"孙元衡","text":"左担鸟路春云鲜，朅来挺辔飞岑颠。\n栈阁关门不容幰，前旌已见临清川。\n清川流水如碧玉，疑是汉江鸭头绿。\n哀丝别管逐风流，骅骝蹀躞空山曲。\n青泥百折度孤城，犹有故时津吏迎。\n舍舟释骑著芒屩，黄冠道士前吹笙。\n两崖洼寥不见底，杳然足下流松声。\n导我方丈谒三祖，授简为作升天行。\n五年前走荒山道，正际泸西初动兵。\n虎咆穷岩鬼啸野，妻拿系累僮仆惊。\n今来拂衣谢荣利，洞壑閒云舒我情。\n梦回风潮振灵海，似有鸾鹤空中鸣。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":35150,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"赠隐士","author":"孙元衡","text":"诗题锦句营心澹，酒酌兰英涤口香。\n伐性已知逃斧凿，澡身原不藉沧浪。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":35151,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"榕树石谷歌","author":"孙元衡","text":"榕生海甸长官宅，冬叶青青拟松柏。\n高干上踰层楼颠，横枝盖地一千尺。\n连蜷偃蹇筋骨露，磥砢盘郁脂膏积。\n赴土藤根蛇尾青，垂空条线龙髯赤。\n黄鸟嘤嘤不露身，白驹仡仡无停隙。\n种植当年好事人，故遣根柯盘怪石。\n磝磝蓊蓊皆有情，相轧相樛共支脉。\n崖颠叶底费吟哦，散发披襟阅朝夕。\n雨中灭窍蒙云烟，风里搔樖斗戈戟。\n不同痴大空滑柔，尽化粗顽得润泽。\n太华青城纷满眼，木石幽居念畴昔。\n此日投荒大海阳，一生剩有烟霞癖。\n息阴枕块发高歌，有酒如渑当醉客。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":35152,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"客自鸡笼还，言形势甚悉","author":"孙元衡","text":"闻道鸡笼屿，孤城莽荡间。\n毒磺糜白石，沸水迸丹山。\n东渡洪波弱，秋崖积雪斑。\n虫鱼俱异物，戍卒几人还！","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":35153,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"与诸昆季言怀 其一","author":"孙元衡","text":"骐骥仰天鸣，朽索驭刚铁。\n一驱升崇山，焉知踬于垤。\n脂牵转回肠，孰与较优劣？\n才老力可尽，名成待九折。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":35154,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"与诸昆季言怀 其二","author":"孙元衡","text":"马兰踸踔生，及时当先刈。\n不刈将如何？\n杜衡恐芜秽。\n蒥荑与揭车，清芬可同佩。\n异物难苟容，孤芳见吾辈。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":35155,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"与诸昆季言怀 其三","author":"孙元衡","text":"李牧捭上首，却克跛而登。\n有力皆可努，如行河上冰。\n晏安乃酖毒，胡为昧寝兴。\n拊髀发长叹，天命良可胜！","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":35156,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"与诸昆季言怀 其四","author":"孙元衡","text":"兰枻持斫冰，冰坚枻伤手。\n我手不足惜，情违力何有？\n智士慎择术，断金若摧朽。\n刜蓬挥棠溪，所用良不苟。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":35157,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"与诸昆季言怀 其五","author":"孙元衡","text":"竹柏无冬春，中心异虚实。\n形骸非所拘，奉此岁寒职。\n吾道守根蒂，焉容事雕饰！\n遭遇难可期，常存但孤直。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":35158,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"与诸昆季言怀 其六","author":"孙元衡","text":"康哉黔娄生，遗我以芳型。\n簟食不充虚，敝衣不盖形。\n僵眠但仰屋，苍苍见寒星。\n恬然守休德，愿子抱遗经。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":35159,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"与诸昆季言怀 其七","author":"孙元衡","text":"脆茵与贞松，久暂俱零落；王鲔与晨风，终当异栖托。\n毋媚庄老言，实寻孔颜乐。\n兰肴齿颊香，与君试清酌。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":35160,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"与诸昆季言怀 其八","author":"孙元衡","text":"子晋去已远，笙在人间吹。\n玉豉得长寿，久处夫何为！\n生理有至乐，知士识端倪。\n四荒同一室，玉食犹餔糜。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":35161,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"与诸昆季言怀 其九","author":"孙元衡","text":"生晚道仍古，禀气得其真。\n一朝伏青白，坐见千秋人。\n黄杨厄馀闰，松桧偕冬春。\n驽骀无辍驾，骐骥共前津。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":35162,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"与诸昆季言怀 其十","author":"孙元衡","text":"文藻薄时艳，乃心在编简。\n嗜古择其腴，如腱贯之。\n片言敌造化，万古明人眼。\n繁词俗所欣，下笔颜亦赧。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":35163,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"与诸昆季言怀 其十一","author":"孙元衡","text":"鹅鸭唼梁藻，鸿鹄高且遐。\n检身事三圭，五缄宁不华。\n无由就悬车，终叹系匏瓜。\n每每原草绿，此邦非我家。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":35164,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"与诸昆季言怀 其十二","author":"孙元衡","text":"云际思好仇，引颈劳空望。\n吞响在幽山，名潜理非亢。\n佳卉时一芳，清泉随所向。\n苕苕孤生桐，何必逢牙旷。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":35165,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"冬日眺远","author":"孙元衡","text":"叶叶征帆似羽翰，排空飞上白云端。\n驰风骋雨无常态，海水那知天地寒！","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":35166,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"客以琴见贻，招张尉闽嘉试弹古调","author":"孙元衡","text":"抱琴相赠谢山翁，仙尉挥弦指法工。\n流水高山无懦响，叩宫弹角有清风。\n刺桐城里烟花静，丛竹墙边鸟雀空。\n味备五音欢百物，蓼根独有避甘虫。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":35167,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"守岁，分乐字，赋得岁熟鸦声乐","author":"孙元衡","text":"慰湣对穷海，忧来自求索。\n招摇指东陆，岁事蛇赴壑。\n人定一鸦啼，佔兆丰登乐。\n三岁迫骄阳，以我禦穷薄。\n物情相慰藉，先声良不恶。\n气候微足徵，天意欣所托。\n拙宦如老农，关心但耕凿。\n雷电司冬令，草木鲜零落。\n好雨过林皋，众星灿寥廓。\n嘿焉念故巢，拂衣谁与作。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":35168,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"除夕雷雨大作","author":"孙元衡","text":"腊月晦日大雷雨，长风挟浪翻高空。\n海中龙蛇厌蟠蛰，世上草木开屯蒙。\n赫怒昔闻殚帝力，妖祥今见烦天工。\n无敢戏渝独危坐，寒花往往能鲜红。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":35169,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"戏成一绝","author":"孙元衡","text":"何必逢人去卖痴，漫添陈火祭新诗。\n沈屯举世都如梦，七十二钻龟不知。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":35170,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"元日，赋得春城回北斗，限城字","author":"孙元衡","text":"春信入边城，东移斗柄横。\n势欹河汉直，光回夜潮平。\n望阙瞻云地，三年万里情。\n此中占气象，天海共澄清。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":35171,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}}]